  "realm_id": "cloudreach",
  "_integration": "Merge each npc with cloudreach_chapter.json by id through CloudreachChapter.npc_specs. This replaces the opening-only npc list. Resolve position_when first matching branch on progression restore/revision; it relocates the same body, never duplicates it. All coordinates are authored world metres and require nearest-elevation grounding. greeting_when uses the production VillageNPCs first-match rule. topic_interactions are optional nearby conversation prompts, independently guarded; they never replace a greeting. Encounter phase dialogue is triggered by the encounter controller, not the NPC greeting.",
  "_portrait_policy": "Aila retains her clean installed owner-reference portrait. Every other named NPC and payoff traveler reuses a W04 clean installed-body render matched through art.json model identity. Portrait filenames retain the Meadows source names; they do not rename Cloudreach speakers. Return conversations stay bound to each traveler's body. Never fall back to trainer.png, reference sheets, or another body's face. If a future named body has no matching clean portrait, explicitly use an empty portrait with hidden_until_clean_portrait and a narrow conversation/speaker binding.",
  "world_choice_flags": ["side_cliff_circuit_tm_chosen"],
  "_why_world_choice_flags": "F07#0: world facts an interaction may write directly (set_physical_flag) that are not shrine vanes; the Cliff Circuit prize choice (one per world).",
